[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1560.549, "timestamp": "00:26:00", "text": "但不是買它，而是在飛船"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1562.95, "timestamp": "00:26:02", "text": "啟動引擎的時候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1565.669, "timestamp": "00:26:05", "text": "，開始狂按 E 鍵，然後在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1567.19, "timestamp": "00:26:07", "text": "加載畫面之間，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1570.07, "timestamp": "00:26:10", "text": "實際上就把它消耗掉了。太瘋狂了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1571.83, "timestamp": "00:26:11", "text": "好的。我還要問："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1573.99, "timestamp": "00:26:13", "text": "如何進入閣樓？哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1575.19, "timestamp": "00:26:15", "text": "堅持，稍等。我會為你做的。不用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1577.43, "timestamp": "00:26:17", "text": "擔心。我，我，我太喜歡打開"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1580.149, "timestamp": "00:26:20", "text": "閣樓了。通常在這一側。哦，找到了。找到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1584.029, "timestamp": "00:26:24", "text": "好的。送我上去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1589.11, "timestamp": "00:26:29", "text": "所以，不。不，送我上去。送我上去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1591.11, "timestamp": "00:26:31", "text": "好的。把它放到架子上，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1594.47, "timestamp": "00:26:34", "text": "然後就像好的。是的。好了。等待。  等待。算了。算了。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1597.51, "timestamp": "00:26:37", "text": "。他讓"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1604.07, "timestamp": "00:26:44", "text": "你有什麼？哦，在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1605.43, "timestamp": "00:26:45", "text": "那裡。哦，東西真多。我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1607.35, "timestamp": "00:26:47", "text": "意思是，有兩個。有手榴彈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1609.19, "timestamp": "00:26:49", "text": "包嗎？我可以要那個嗎？兩者都有。  這裡有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1612.31, "timestamp": "00:26:52", "text": "一顆普通的人體手榴彈和一顆"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1615.43, "timestamp": "00:26:55", "text": "手榴彈。兩者都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1618.63, "timestamp": "00:26:58", "text": "Oh my up。"}]